.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store

# Scratch the Postman dataset engine materialises under a dataset's data_dir
# (.resources): sqlite caches, the daemon log, and a per-run UUID directory. All of it
# is rebuilt on every `postman collection run --iteration-data-dataset`, so it is build
# output rather than data.
#
# Two deliberate limits on how wide this goes:
#   - Scoped to postman/datasets/**. Collections keep a tracked
#     .resources/definition.yaml, so ignoring .resources/ globally would drop all three
#     collection definitions from the repo.
#   - Matches only the engine's own artefacts, not .resources/ wholesale. A datasource
#     added without --ref-only has its CSV/JSON copied in here, and that copy is real
#     data that must stay tracked.
postman/datasets/**/.resources/*.db
postman/datasets/**/.resources/*.log
postman/datasets/**/.resources/*/
